      "es": "# Command 1100 - HSM Extended Software Version\n\n- **Command ID:** `1100`\n- **Title:** HSM Extended Software Version\n- **PDF Pages:** 1330 - 1330\n\n---\n\n### Description\n\nCommand 1100 returns the extended software image version, image CRC checksum, and the product code of the HSM.\n\n### Command Syntax\n\n```\n<1100#>\n```\n\n### Response Syntax\n\n```\n<2100#Extended Software Version Information#>[CRLF]\n```\n\n### Command Parameters\n\n| Field | Name | Length | Description |\n| :--- | :--- | :---: | :--- |\n| 0 | Command identifier 4 |  | 1100 |\n\n### Response Parameters\n\n| Field | Name | Length | Description |\n| :--- | :--- | :---: | :--- |\n| 0 | Response identifier 4 |  | 2100 |\n| 1 | Extended Software Variable Version Information |  | The HSM extended software version information. |\n\n### Examples\n\nExamples\n\nThe command looks like this:\n\n```\n<1100#>\n```\n\n```\n<2100#Atalla  HSM  AT1000-AKB  Version:  8.60.0.0, Date:  Jul  15  2024, Time:16:24:41#>\n```\n\n```\n<2100#Atalla  HSM  AT1000-VAR  Version:  8.60.0.0, Date:  Jul  15  2024, Time:16:25:37#>\n```\n\n```\n<2100#Atalla HSM AT1000-AKB PCI-HSM Version: 8.60.0.0, Date: Jul 15 2024, Time:16:26:40#>\n```\n\n",
      "en": "# Command 1100 - HSM Extended Software Version\n\n- **Command ID:** `1100`\n- **Title:** HSM Extended Software Version\n- **PDF Pages:** 1330 - 1330\n\n---\n\n### Description\n\nCommand 1100 returns the extended software image version, image CRC checksum, and the product code of the HSM.\n\n### Command Syntax\n\n```\n<1100#>\n```\n\n### Response Syntax\n\n```\n<2100#Extended Software Version Information#>[CRLF]\n```\n\n### Command Parameters\n\n| Field | Name | Length | Description |\n| :--- | :--- | :---: | :--- |\n| 0 | Command identifier 4 |  | 1100 |\n\n### Response Parameters\n\n| Field | Name | Length | Description |\n| :--- | :--- | :---: | :--- |\n| 0 | Response identifier 4 |  | 2100 |\n| 1 | Extended Software Variable Version Information |  | The HSM extended software version information. |\n\n### Examples\n\nExamples\n\nThe command looks like this:\n\n```\n<1100#>\n```\n\n```\n<2100#Atalla  HSM  AT1000-AKB  Version:  8.60.0.0, Date:  Jul  15  2024, Time:16:24:41#>\n```\n\n```\n<2100#Atalla  HSM  AT1000-VAR  Version:  8.60.0.0, Date:  Jul  15  2024, Time:16:25:37#>\n```\n\n```\n<2100#Atalla HSM AT1000-AKB PCI-HSM Version: 8.60.0.0, Date: Jul 15 2024, Time:16:26:40#>\n```\n\n"
