    "markdownDoc": {
      "es": "# Command 1110 - HSM System Configuration Information\n\n- **Command ID:** `1110`\n- **Title:** HSM System Configuration Information\n- **PDF Pages:** 1336 - 1336\n\n---\n\n### Description\n\nCommand 1110 returns the HSM system software information, and cryptographic subsystem software version information.\n\n### Command Syntax\n\n```\n<1110#>\n```\n\n### Response Syntax\n\n```\n<2110#Software Version Information#Image ID#Image CRC Checksum# Product Code#>[CRLF]\n```\n\n### Command Parameters\n\n| Field | Name | Length | Description |\n| :--- | :--- | :---: | :--- |\n| 0 | Command identifier 4 |  | 1110 |\n\n### Response Parameters\n\n| Field | Name | Length | Description |\n| :--- | :--- | :---: | :--- |\n| 0 | Response identifier 4 |  | 2110 |\n| 1 | Software Version Variable |  | The HSM software version information. |\n| 2 | Image ID Variable |  | The HSM image name, version number and creation date. |\n| 3 | Image CRC Checksum 4 |  | The CRC checksum of the HSM software. |\n| 4 | Product Code 1 |  | This field contains a decimal digit, 3 indicates AT1000. |\n\n### Usage Notes\n\n- Use command <1100#> to obtain the extended HSM software version information.\n\n### Examples\n\nExamples\n\nThe command looks like this:\n\n```\n<1110#>\n```\n\n```\n<2110#AT1000,  Version:  8.60,  Date:  Jul  15  2024,  Time:  16:24:38#Atalla  HSMAT1000-AKB  Version:  8.60, Date:  Jul  15  2024,  Time:  16:24:41#FC67#3#>\n```\n\n```\n<2110#AT1000,  Version:  8.60,  Date:  Jul  15  2024,  Time:  16:25:34#Atalla  HSMAT1000-VAR  Version:  8.60, Date:  Jul  15  2024,  Time:  16:25:37#11C6#3#>\n```\n\n```\n<2110#AT1000,  Version:  8.60,  Date:  Jul  15  2024,  Time:  16:26:36#Atalla  HSMAT1000-AKB  PCI-HSM  Version:  8.60,  Date:  Jul  15 2024,  Time:  16:26:40#0551#3#>\n```\n\n",
      "en": "# Command 1110 - HSM System Configuration Information\n\n- **Command ID:** `1110`\n- **Title:** HSM System Configuration Information\n- **PDF Pages:** 1336 - 1336\n\n---\n\n### Description\n\nCommand 1110 returns the HSM system software information, and cryptographic subsystem software version information.\n\n### Command Syntax\n\n```\n<1110#>\n```\n\n### Response Syntax\n\n```\n<2110#Software Version Information#Image ID#Image CRC Checksum# Product Code#>[CRLF]\n```\n\n### Command Parameters\n\n| Field | Name | Length | Description |\n| :--- | :--- | :---: | :--- |\n| 0 | Command identifier 4 |  | 1110 |\n\n### Response Parameters\n\n| Field | Name | Length | Description |\n| :--- | :--- | :---: | :--- |\n| 0 | Response identifier 4 |  | 2110 |\n| 1 | Software Version Variable |  | The HSM software version information. |\n| 2 | Image ID Variable |  | The HSM image name, version number and creation date. |\n| 3 | Image CRC Checksum 4 |  | The CRC checksum of the HSM software. |\n| 4 | Product Code 1 |  | This field contains a decimal digit, 3 indicates AT1000. |\n\n### Usage Notes\n\n- Use command <1100#> to obtain the extended HSM software version information.\n\n### Examples\n\nExamples\n\nThe command looks like this:\n\n```\n<1110#>\n```\n\n```\n<2110#AT1000,  Version:  8.60,  Date:  Jul  15  2024,  Time:  16:24:38#Atalla  HSMAT1000-AKB  Version:  8.60, Date:  Jul  15  2024,  Time:  16:24:41#FC67#3#>\n```\n\n```\n<2110#AT1000,  Version:  8.60,  Date:  Jul  15  2024,  Time:  16:25:34#Atalla  HSMAT1000-VAR  Version:  8.60, Date:  Jul  15  2024,  Time:  16:25:37#11C6#3#>\n```\n\n```\n<2110#AT1000,  Version:  8.60,  Date:  Jul  15  2024,  Time:  16:26:36#Atalla  HSMAT1000-AKB  PCI-HSM  Version:  8.60,  Date:  Jul  15 2024,  Time:  16:26:40#0551#3#>\n```\n\n"
    },
