          "es": "[AKB] The KEK encrypted under the MFK. This key encrypts the Working Key. The headers allowed in this field depend on whether options E2 or E3 are enabled, and whether an AES MFK is loaded. This field contains 74 printable ASCII characters, or a volatile table location. AES MFK E2 E3 Supported headers No No No 1KDE*000, where * = E or N No Yes No 1KDE*000, 1KDN*000 where * = E or N No No Yes 1KDE*000, 1ADE*000 where * = E or N No Yes Yes 1KDE*000, 1KDN*000, 1ADE*000, 1ADN*000, where * = E or N Yes No No 1KDE*000, where * = E or N 3KDE*000, where * = E, N, or S Yes Yes No 1KDE*000, 1KDN*000, where * = E or N 3KDE*000, 3KDN*000, where * = E, N, or S Yes No Yes 1KDE*000, 1ADE*000, where * = E or N 3KDE*000, 3ADE*000, where * = E, N, or S Yes Yes Yes 1KDE*000, 1KDN*000, 1ADE*000, 1ADN*000, where * = E or N 3KDE*000, 3KDN*000, 3ADE*000, 3ADN*000, where * = E, N, or S | [VARIANT] The KEK is 3DES-ECB encrypted under variant zero of the MFK. This key encrypts the Working Key. This field can contain 16 or 32 hexadecimal characters, a volatile table location.",
          "en": "[AKB] The KEK encrypted under the MFK. This key encrypts the Working Key. The headers allowed in this field depend on whether options E2 or E3 are enabled, and whether an AES MFK is loaded. This field contains 74 printable ASCII characters, or a volatile table location. AES MFK E2 E3 Supported headers No No No 1KDE*000, where * = E or N No Yes No 1KDE*000, 1KDN*000 where * = E or N No No Yes 1KDE*000, 1ADE*000 where * = E or N No Yes Yes 1KDE*000, 1KDN*000, 1ADE*000, 1ADN*000, where * = E or N Yes No No 1KDE*000, where * = E or N 3KDE*000, where * = E, N, or S Yes Yes No 1KDE*000, 1KDN*000, where * = E or N 3KDE*000, 3KDN*000, where * = E, N, or S Yes No Yes 1KDE*000, 1ADE*000, where * = E or N 3KDE*000, 3ADE*000, where * = E, N, or S Yes Yes Yes 1KDE*000, 1KDN*000, 1ADE*000, 1ADN*000, where * = E or N 3KDE*000, 3KDN*000, 3ADE*000, 3ADN*000, where * = E, N, or S | [VARIANT] The KEK is 3DES-ECB encrypted under variant zero of the MFK. This key encrypts the Working Key. This field can contain 16 or 32 hexadecimal characters, a volatile table location."
