    "markdownDoc": {
      "es": "# Command 12B - Translate Public or Private Key AKB from MFK to PMFK\n\n- **Command ID:** `12B`\n- **Title:** Translate Public or Private Key AKB from MFK to PMFK\n- **PDF Pages:** 791 - 793\n\n---\n\n### Key Management Compatibility\n\n| Key Type | Default Setting | MFK Type |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| 🌸 AKB | Disabled | 3DES, AES |\n| 🟪 Variant | Enabled | 3DES |\n\n### Command Syntax\n\n```\n<12B#Public Key or Private Key#>\n```\n\n### Response Syntax\n\n```\n<22B#Public Key or Private Key#>\n```\n\n### Command Parameters\n\n| Field | Name | Length | Description |\n| :--- | :--- | :---: | :--- |\n| 0 | Command identifier 3 |  | 12B |\n| 1 | Public Key or Variable Private Key |  | The AKB of the RSA, ECDSA, or ECDH public or private key encrypted under the MFK. Public Key Headers Supported: 3DES MFK 1KREE000, 1SRVE000, 1pRVE000, 1kRE*000, 1wRV*000, where * = E or N. Headers Supported: AES MFK 3KRE*000, 3SRV*000, 3pRV*000, , 3kRE*000, 3wRV*000, 3PRE*000, 3RRVN000, 3RRVN00k, 3ZRD*000, where * = E or N, where * = E, N, or S. Private Key Headers Supported: 3DES MFK 1KRDE000, 1SRGE000, 1pRGE000, 1kRDE000, 1kRDN000, 1wRG*000, 1wRS*000, where * = E or N. Headers Supported: AES MFK 3KRD*000, 3SRG*000, 3pRG*000, 3kRD*000, 3wRGE000, 3wRGN000, 3PRD*000, where * = E, N, or S. Legal Characters: Printable ASCII |\n\n### Response Parameters\n\n| Field | Name | Length | Description |\n| :--- | :--- | :---: | :--- |\n| 0 | Response identifier 2 |  | 22B |\n| 1 | Public Key or Variable Private Key |  | The AKB of the RSA, ECDSA or ECDH public or private key encrypted under the PMFK. Legal Characters: Printable ASCII |\n\n### Usage Notes\n\n- When the HSM does not have a Pending MFK, this error response is returned <00#0800zz#>\n- When the HSM is operating in PCI-HSM mode and contains a 3key-3DES MFK, the maximum size of the RSA key in AKBv1 format is 2048 bits. RSA keys under the AES MFK are unlimited.\n- When the HSM is operating in PCI-HSM mode and contains a 2key-3DES MFK, the maximum size of the RSA key in AKBv1 format is 1024 bits. RSA keys under the AES MFK are unlimited.\n\n### Examples\n\nExamples\n\nExample 1\n\nPublic Key:\n\nThe command looks like this:\n\n```\n<12B#1SRVE000,,F7929A1B295C6A00#>\n```\n\nThe HSM returns this response:\n\n```\n<22B#1SRVE000,,85C75ED0FABAC842#>\n```\n\nComponent 1 = 920548E6FEB14A62 0BD145B66B72A3BB 58652863425A38A9 AA91F716077C4B06,\n\nComponent 2 = 920559F7DC9379514F9510E30D14D4CCD0EDB1FAE8F08312665D2ACBE992B4F9,\n\nThe command looks like this:\n\n```\n<12B#3seGE000,,975915E967C6F4C080F02C14BD98FCF1#>\n```\n\nThe HSM returns this response:\n\n```\n<22B#3seGE000,,22971D8CB20E807C8255AE8FD91B7FFF#>\n```\n\n",
      "en": "# Command 12B - Translate Public or Private Key AKB from MFK to PMFK\n\n- **Command ID:** `12B`\n- **Title:** Translate Public or Private Key AKB from MFK to PMFK\n- **PDF Pages:** 791 - 793\n\n---\n\n### Key Management Compatibility\n\n| Key Type | Default Setting | MFK Type |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| 🌸 AKB | Disabled | 3DES, AES |\n| 🟪 Variant | Enabled | 3DES |\n\n### Command Syntax\n\n```\n<12B#Public Key or Private Key#>\n```\n\n### Response Syntax\n\n```\n<22B#Public Key or Private Key#>\n```\n\n### Command Parameters\n\n| Field | Name | Length | Description |\n| :--- | :--- | :---: | :--- |\n| 0 | Command identifier 3 |  | 12B |\n| 1 | Public Key or Variable Private Key |  | The AKB of the RSA, ECDSA, or ECDH public or private key encrypted under the MFK. Public Key Headers Supported: 3DES MFK 1KREE000, 1SRVE000, 1pRVE000, 1kRE*000, 1wRV*000, where * = E or N. Headers Supported: AES MFK 3KRE*000, 3SRV*000, 3pRV*000, , 3kRE*000, 3wRV*000, 3PRE*000, 3RRVN000, 3RRVN00k, 3ZRD*000, where * = E or N, where * = E, N, or S. Private Key Headers Supported: 3DES MFK 1KRDE000, 1SRGE000, 1pRGE000, 1kRDE000, 1kRDN000, 1wRG*000, 1wRS*000, where * = E or N. Headers Supported: AES MFK 3KRD*000, 3SRG*000, 3pRG*000, 3kRD*000, 3wRGE000, 3wRGN000, 3PRD*000, where * = E, N, or S. Legal Characters: Printable ASCII |\n\n### Response Parameters\n\n| Field | Name | Length | Description |\n| :--- | :--- | :---: | :--- |\n| 0 | Response identifier 2 |  | 22B |\n| 1 | Public Key or Variable Private Key |  | The AKB of the RSA, ECDSA or ECDH public or private key encrypted under the PMFK. Legal Characters: Printable ASCII |\n\n### Usage Notes\n\n- When the HSM does not have a Pending MFK, this error response is returned <00#0800zz#>\n- When the HSM is operating in PCI-HSM mode and contains a 3key-3DES MFK, the maximum size of the RSA key in AKBv1 format is 2048 bits. RSA keys under the AES MFK are unlimited.\n- When the HSM is operating in PCI-HSM mode and contains a 2key-3DES MFK, the maximum size of the RSA key in AKBv1 format is 1024 bits. RSA keys under the AES MFK are unlimited.\n\n### Examples\n\nExamples\n\nExample 1\n\nPublic Key:\n\nThe command looks like this:\n\n```\n<12B#1SRVE000,,F7929A1B295C6A00#>\n```\n\nThe HSM returns this response:\n\n```\n<22B#1SRVE000,,85C75ED0FABAC842#>\n```\n\nComponent 1 = 920548E6FEB14A62 0BD145B66B72A3BB 58652863425A38A9 AA91F716077C4B06,\n\nComponent 2 = 920559F7DC9379514F9510E30D14D4CCD0EDB1FAE8F08312665D2ACBE992B4F9,\n\nThe command looks like this:\n\n```\n<12B#3seGE000,,975915E967C6F4C080F02C14BD98FCF1#>\n```\n\nThe HSM returns this response:\n\n```\n<22B#3seGE000,,22971D8CB20E807C8255AE8FD91B7FFF#>\n```\n\n"
    },
