          "en": "This field is optional. When present, it contains eight printable ASCII characters which is the AKB header of the generated ATM Master Key returned in field 2 of the response. Headers Supported: 3DES MFK 1kDNE000, 1KDNE000 Headers Supported: AES MFK 3kDNE000, 3KDNE000 Headers Supported: NOTE: When this field is not present, the AKB header is 1KDNE000 or 3KDNE000."
