        "en": "[CAUTION] There is no dual control over this command, so any user of the HSM can introduce a public key. Keys loaded this way can never be used to encrypt PIN keys or key wrapping keys that can protect PIN keys, because PIN keys and the keys that protect them must always be under dual control."
