              "en": "The allowed format is 012. Each of the CRT components are separately encrypted using CBC encryption mode using an all zero initialization vector. The padding method is ISO 9797-1 padding method 2 (mandatory padding with a 0x80 byte, followed by optional 0x00 bytes to the block length). Legal Characters: 012"
