          "es": "The AKB of Component-1. Byte 6 of the key component header must contain one of the following values: C, 1, 2, 3, 4, i, e, k, or n. This field contains 74 printable ASCII characters when the key component is a 3DES key component. When the key component is an AES key component, this field can contain 74, 90, 106, 110 printable ASCII characters.",
          "en": "The AKB of Component-1. Byte 6 of the key component header must contain one of the following values: C, 1, 2, 3, 4, i, e, k, or n. This field contains 74 printable ASCII characters when the key component is a 3DES key component. When the key component is an AES key component, this field can contain 74, 90, 106, 110 printable ASCII characters."
