              "en": "This field contains the continuation flag. The following values are allowed: 0 - The entire PIN letter is included in this command. 1 - This command contains the first block of a multi-block PIN letter template. 2 - This command contains an intermediate block of a multi-block PIN letter template. 3 - The command contains the final block of a multi-block PIN letter template. 4 - Cancel current print job; removes a partial PIN letter template from HSM’s memory."
