              "en": "Field 1 contains a decimal digit, where: Type Discover CVN 05, 06, 15, and 16 2 EMV2000 (tree-based technique) 8 EMV-Tree Proprietary - uses the EMV 2000 9 key derivation, but uses the ICC MK for ARPC calculation EMV 4.1 Specification Update Bulletin 46 2 EMV Cryptogram version 5 2 Europay/MasterCard MChip4 version 1.1 0 JCB CVN 01 1, 3 JCB CVN 04 2 MasterCard MChip4, v 1.1 CVN 10 and 11 0 (MasterCard proprietary SKD) MasterCard MChip4, v 1.1 CVN 12 and 13 8 (EMV 2000 SKD) MasterCard MChip4, v 1.1 CVN 14 and 15 2 (EMV CSK) NSICCS (Indonesia) 2008 version 5 NSICCS (Indonesia) 2012 version 2 Visa CVN 10 and 17 1, 3 Visa CVN 14 3 Visa CVN 18, 22 and 42 2 UnionPay International (UPI) 4  Derivation types 0 and 9 use the derived session key to verify the ARQC and the ICC master key to generate the ARPC.  Derivation types 1 and 3 use the ICC master key to generate both the ARQC and ARPC. They are identical, either can be used.  Derivation types 2, 4,5, and 8 use the session key for both ARQC and ARPC."
