          "es": "The contents of this field depends on the derivation type specified in field 1. For type 5, this field must be 16 characters and the first four characters must be zero.  Common session (derivation type = 2), this field contains 16 hexadecimal characters, where: Application Transaction Counter (ATC). This binary value is converted to 4 hexadecimal characters. It is right padded with 12 zeros.  UnionPay International (derivation type = 4), this field contains 4 hexadecimal characters, where: Application Transaction Counter (ATC). This binary value is converted to 4 hexadecimal characters.  EMV-Tree (derivation type = 8 or 9), this field contains 4 hexadecimal characters, where: Application Transaction Counter (ATC). This binary value is converted to 4 hexadecimal characters.  Visa (derivation type = 1 or 3), this field must be empty.  Europay/MasterCard (derivation type = 0), this field contains 16 hexadecimal characters, where:  Application Transaction Counter (ATC). This binary value is converted to 4 hexadecimal characters. It is right padded with 12 zeros. or  Application Transaction Counter (ATC). This binary value is converted to 4 hexadecimal characters, followed by 0000 (4 zeros), followed by the Unpredictable Number, in which the binary value is converted to 8 hexadecimal characters.  NSICCS (2008) (derivation type = 5), this field contains 16 hexadecimal characters and the first four must be zero. Legal Characters: 0-9, A-F",
