        "es": "[NOTE] exportability ‘N’ is allowed in this field but not recommended for users. Field 1 contains Headers allowed in field 5 Key Type Header IMK-AC 3DES MFK 3DES MFK 1mENE000, 1fENE000, 1fENN000, 1mENN000 AES MFK AES MFK 3mEN*000, where * = 3fEN*000, where * = E, E, N or S N or S IMK-MAC 3DES MFK 3DES MFK 1mENE00M, 1fENE00M, 1mENN000 1fENN00M AES MFK AES MFK 3mEN*00M, where * 3fEN*00M, where * = = E, N or S E, N or S IMK-ENC 3DES MFK 3DES MFK 1mEN*00E, 1fENE00E, 1fENN00E 1mENN00E AES MFK AES MFK 3mEN*00E, where * = 3fEN*00E, where * = E, E, N or S N or S IMK-DN 3DES MFK 3DES MFK 1mEN*00e, where * = 1fENE00e, 1fENN00e E or N AES MFK AES MFK 3mEN*00e, where * = 3fEN*00e, where * = E, E, N or S N, or S. IMK-DAC 3DES MFK 3DES MFK 1mEN*00e, where * = 1fENE00d, 1fENN00d E or N AES MFK AES MFK 3mEN*00e, where * = 3fEN*00d, where * = E, E, N or S N, or S. Proprietary 3DES MFK Not supported. If any 1miNE000, value is present in this 1miNN000 field, the HSM will return a detailed error AES MFK 620. 3miN*000, where * = E, N or S |",
