          "es": "The CVV, CVC, or CSC(s) to be verified. The CVV/CVC can be 1 - 8 decimal digits. When option 4D is enabled, this field must contain 3 - 8 decimal digits. There are three lengths of CSC values that can be verified: a 5-digit CSC, a 4-digit CSC, and a 3-digit CSC. To verify multiple CSC values they must be specified in decreasing length order and be separated by a comma. Only one value per CSC length can be specified per command.",
