              "en": "The contents of this field depends on the derivation type specified in field 1. Common session (derivation type = 0 or 8), this field contains 16 hexadecimal characters as defined in Specification Update Bulletin 46. For all other derivation types this field contains the Application Transaction Counter (ATC). This binary value is converted to 4 hexadecimal characters."
