      "es": "# Command 73 - Clear Section of Volatile Table\n\n- **Command ID:** `73`\n- **Title:** Clear Section of Volatile Table\n- **PDF Pages:** 503 - 504\n\n---\n\n### Description\n\nCommand 73 clears a section of the volatile table. Reference Information: Section 8, “Storing values in the volatile table.” CAUTION: Before sending this command, make sure no other host application is using the volatile table.\n\n### Key Management Compatibility\n\n| Key Type | Default Setting | MFK Type |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| 🌸 AKB | Enabled | 3DES, AES |\n| 🟪 Variant | Enabled | 3DES |\n\n### Command Syntax\n\n```\n<73#[Table Section#]>\n```\n\n### Response Syntax\n\n```\n<83#OK#>[CRLF]\n```\n\n### Command Parameters\n\n| Field | Name | Length | Description |\n| :--- | :--- | :---: | :--- |\n| 0 | Command identifier | 2 | 73 |\n| 1 | [Table Section#] | [1] [0] | This field is optional. When present, it specifies the section of the table. This field contains a decimal digit, where: 0 = DES key or conversion table section 1 = Diebold Number Table section When this field is not present, the volatile table section is section 0. This field must not exist |\n\n### Response Parameters\n\n| Field | Name | Length | Description |\n| :--- | :--- | :---: | :--- |\n| 0 | Response identifier | 2 | 83 |\n| 1 | OK | 2 | The table has been cleared. |\n\n> [!CAUTION]\n> **CAUTION:** Before sending this command, make sure no other host application is using the volatile table.\n\n",
      "en": "# Command 73 - Clear Section of Volatile Table\n\n- **Command ID:** `73`\n- **Title:** Clear Section of Volatile Table\n- **PDF Pages:** 503 - 504\n\n---\n\n### Description\n\nCommand 73 clears a section of the volatile table. Reference Information: Section 8, “Storing values in the volatile table.” CAUTION: Before sending this command, make sure no other host application is using the volatile table.\n\n### Key Management Compatibility\n\n| Key Type | Default Setting | MFK Type |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| 🌸 AKB | Enabled | 3DES, AES |\n| 🟪 Variant | Enabled | 3DES |\n\n### Command Syntax\n\n```\n<73#[Table Section#]>\n```\n\n### Response Syntax\n\n```\n<83#OK#>[CRLF]\n```\n\n### Command Parameters\n\n| Field | Name | Length | Description |\n| :--- | :--- | :---: | :--- |\n| 0 | Command identifier | 2 | 73 |\n| 1 | [Table Section#] | [1] [0] | This field is optional. When present, it specifies the section of the table. This field contains a decimal digit, where: 0 = DES key or conversion table section 1 = Diebold Number Table section When this field is not present, the volatile table section is section 0. This field must not exist |\n\n### Response Parameters\n\n| Field | Name | Length | Description |\n| :--- | :--- | :---: | :--- |\n| 0 | Response identifier | 2 | 83 |\n| 1 | OK | 2 | The table has been cleared. |\n\n> [!CAUTION]\n> **CAUTION:** Before sending this command, make sure no other host application is using the volatile table.\n\n"
