    "source": "Utimaco Atalla AT1000 Command Reference Manual v8.60 (Command 9A)",
    "markdownDoc": {
      "es": "# Command 9A - HSM Status Key\n\n- **Command ID:** `9A`\n- **Title:** HSM Status Key\n- **PDF Pages:** 596 - 598\n\n---\n\n### Description\n\nCommand 9A returns the number of available key locations in the volatile table, as well as the name, check digits, and length of the 3DES and AES Master File Keys stored in the HSM’s non-volatile key table.\n\n### Key Management Compatibility\n\n| Key Type | Default Setting | MFK Type |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| 🌸 AKB | Enabled | 3DES, AES |\n| 🟪 Variant | Enabled | 3DES |\n\n### Command Syntax\n\n```\n<9A#KEY#>\n```\n\n### Response Syntax\n\n```\n<AA#Remaining Locations#[MFK Name]#[MFK Check Digits]#[MFK Length]# [Pending MFK Name]#[Pending MFK Check Digits]#[Pending MFK Length]# [AES MFK Name]#[AES MFK Check Digits]#[AES MFK Length]# [AES Pending MFK Name]#[AES Pending MFK Check Digits]# [AES Pending MFK Length]#>[CRLF]\n```\n\n### Command Parameters\n\n| Field | Name | Length | Description |\n| :--- | :--- | :---: | :--- |\n| 0 | Command identifier | 2 | 9A |\n| 1 | 1 | 3 | KEY |\n\n### Response Parameters\n\n| Field | Name | Length | Description |\n| :--- | :--- | :---: | :--- |\n| 0 | Response identifier | 2 | AA |\n| 1 | Remaining Locations | 4 | This field contains a 4 digit decimal number. This value does not include the key locations available for Diebold Number Tables. |\n| 2 | [MFK Name#] | [4, 5] | The 3DES Master File Key’s name, MFK1. This field is empty if a 3DES Master File Key does not exist. |\n| 3 | [MFK Check Digits#] | [4] | The 3DES Master File Key’s check digits. This field is empty if a 3DES Master File Key does not exist. |\n| 4 | [MFK Length#] | [1] | The 3DES Master File Key’s length, where: D = Double-Length T = Triple-Length This field is empty if a 3DES Master File Key does not exist. |\n| 5 | [Pending MFK Name#] | [4, 5] | The 3DES Pending Master File Key’s name, MFK1. This field is empty if a 3DES Master File Key does not exist. |\n| 6 | [Pending MFK Check Digits#] | [4] | The 3DES Pending Master File Key’s check digits. This field is empty if a 3DES Master File Key does not exist. |\n| 7 | [Pending MFK Length#] | [1] | The 3DES Pending Master File Key’s length, where: D = Double-Length T = Triple-Length This field is empty if a 3DES Master File Key does not exist. |\n| 8 | 🌸 [AES MFK Name#] (AKB) | [4, 5] | The AES Master File Key’s name, AMK1. This field is empty if a AES Master File Key does not exist. |\n| 8 | 🟪 [AES MFK Name#] (Variant) | 0 | This field is empty. |\n| 9 | 🌸 [AES MFK Check Digits#] (AKB) | [4] | The AES Master File Key’s check digits. This field is empty if a AES Master File Key does not exist. |\n| 9 | 🟪 [AES MFK Check Digits#] (Variant) | 0 | This field is empty. |\n| 10 | 🌸 [AES MFK Length#] (AKB) | [1] | The AES Master File Key’s length, where: 4 = 256 bits This field is empty if a AES Master File Key does not exist. |\n| 10 | 🟪 [AES MFK Length#] (Variant) | 0 | This field is empty. |\n| 11 | 🌸 [Pending AES MFK Name#] (AKB) | [5, 6] | The AES Pending Master File Key’s name, PAMK1. This field is empty if a AES Master File Key does not exist. |\n| 11 | 🟪 [Pending AES MFK Name#] (Variant) | 0 | This field is empty. |\n| 12 | 🌸 [Pending AES MFK Check Digits#] (AKB) | [4] | The AES Pending Master File Key’s check digits. This field is empty if a AES Master File Key does not exist. |\n| 12 | 🟪 [Pending AES MFK Check Digits#] (Variant) | 0 | This field is empty. |\n| 13 | 🌸 [Pending AES MFK Length#] (AKB) | [1] | The AES Pending Master File Key’s length, where: 4 = 256 bits This field is empty if a AES Master File Key does not exist. |\n| 13 | 🟪 [Pending AES MFK Length#] (Variant) | 0 | This field is empty. |\n\n",
      "en": "# Command 9A - HSM Status Key\n\n- **Command ID:** `9A`\n- **Title:** HSM Status Key\n- **PDF Pages:** 596 - 598\n\n---\n\n### Description\n\nCommand 9A returns the number of available key locations in the volatile table, as well as the name, check digits, and length of the 3DES and AES Master File Keys stored in the HSM’s non-volatile key table.\n\n### Key Management Compatibility\n\n| Key Type | Default Setting | MFK Type |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| 🌸 AKB | Enabled | 3DES, AES |\n| 🟪 Variant | Enabled | 3DES |\n\n### Command Syntax\n\n```\n<9A#KEY#>\n```\n\n### Response Syntax\n\n```\n<AA#Remaining Locations#[MFK Name]#[MFK Check Digits]#[MFK Length]# [Pending MFK Name]#[Pending MFK Check Digits]#[Pending MFK Length]# [AES MFK Name]#[AES MFK Check Digits]#[AES MFK Length]# [AES Pending MFK Name]#[AES Pending MFK Check Digits]# [AES Pending MFK Length]#>[CRLF]\n```\n\n### Command Parameters\n\n| Field | Name | Length | Description |\n| :--- | :--- | :---: | :--- |\n| 0 | Command identifier | 2 | 9A |\n| 1 | 1 | 3 | KEY |\n\n### Response Parameters\n\n| Field | Name | Length | Description |\n| :--- | :--- | :---: | :--- |\n| 0 | Response identifier | 2 | AA |\n| 1 | Remaining Locations | 4 | This field contains a 4 digit decimal number. This value does not include the key locations available for Diebold Number Tables. |\n| 2 | [MFK Name#] | [4, 5] | The 3DES Master File Key’s name, MFK1. This field is empty if a 3DES Master File Key does not exist. |\n| 3 | [MFK Check Digits#] | [4] | The 3DES Master File Key’s check digits. This field is empty if a 3DES Master File Key does not exist. |\n| 4 | [MFK Length#] | [1] | The 3DES Master File Key’s length, where: D = Double-Length T = Triple-Length This field is empty if a 3DES Master File Key does not exist. |\n| 5 | [Pending MFK Name#] | [4, 5] | The 3DES Pending Master File Key’s name, MFK1. This field is empty if a 3DES Master File Key does not exist. |\n| 6 | [Pending MFK Check Digits#] | [4] | The 3DES Pending Master File Key’s check digits. This field is empty if a 3DES Master File Key does not exist. |\n| 7 | [Pending MFK Length#] | [1] | The 3DES Pending Master File Key’s length, where: D = Double-Length T = Triple-Length This field is empty if a 3DES Master File Key does not exist. |\n| 8 | 🌸 [AES MFK Name#] (AKB) | [4, 5] | The AES Master File Key’s name, AMK1. This field is empty if a AES Master File Key does not exist. |\n| 8 | 🟪 [AES MFK Name#] (Variant) | 0 | This field is empty. |\n| 9 | 🌸 [AES MFK Check Digits#] (AKB) | [4] | The AES Master File Key’s check digits. This field is empty if a AES Master File Key does not exist. |\n| 9 | 🟪 [AES MFK Check Digits#] (Variant) | 0 | This field is empty. |\n| 10 | 🌸 [AES MFK Length#] (AKB) | [1] | The AES Master File Key’s length, where: 4 = 256 bits This field is empty if a AES Master File Key does not exist. |\n| 10 | 🟪 [AES MFK Length#] (Variant) | 0 | This field is empty. |\n| 11 | 🌸 [Pending AES MFK Name#] (AKB) | [5, 6] | The AES Pending Master File Key’s name, PAMK1. This field is empty if a AES Master File Key does not exist. |\n| 11 | 🟪 [Pending AES MFK Name#] (Variant) | 0 | This field is empty. |\n| 12 | 🌸 [Pending AES MFK Check Digits#] (AKB) | [4] | The AES Pending Master File Key’s check digits. This field is empty if a AES Master File Key does not exist. |\n| 12 | 🟪 [Pending AES MFK Check Digits#] (Variant) | 0 | This field is empty. |\n| 13 | 🌸 [Pending AES MFK Length#] (AKB) | [1] | The AES Pending Master File Key’s length, where: 4 = 256 bits This field is empty if a AES Master File Key does not exist. |\n| 13 | 🟪 [Pending AES MFK Length#] (Variant) | 0 | This field is empty. |\n\n"
    },
